sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Participant A
    actor B as Participant B
    participant H as ChatHub
    participant PT as PresenceTracker
    participant DB as SQL Server

    A->>H: connect (same JWT as REST)
    H->>PT: add connection for user A
    PT-->>H: A is now online (set became non-empty)
    H-->>B: presence - A online

    A->>H: typing
    H-->>B: typing indicator (never persisted)

    A->>H: send message
    H->>DB: persist message
    Note over H,DB: persist first, push second - a pushed-but-unstored<br/>message is lost on reconnect
    H-->>B: deliver
    H-->>A: delivered

    B->>H: open conversation
    H->>DB: mark messages read (server-side, not a client claim)
    H-->>A: read receipt

    A->>H: disconnect (tab closed)
    H->>PT: remove connection
    alt other connections remain
        PT-->>H: still online
    else last connection
        PT->>DB: write LastSeenUtc
        H-->>B: presence - A offline
    end
